      "id": "2071799851956982059",
      "text": "What it does:\n\n60+ presets, or build your own\nOne-click export to Figma Motion — editable layer per particle w/ real keyframes\nText stays as live editable text\nGlow, blur, shadow &amp; blend modes carry over as native effects\nStays fully editable on canvas — no flattened images",
