      "id": "2071769482075283747",
      "text": "It seems Figma Motion didn't add any easings to Figma's transition curves. You get ease in/out/in-out, overshoot, a spring and 1 cubic Bezier.\n\nIt pained me when this talk's motion capture demo produced interesting curves, but then the nuances were crushed by Figma's limitations.",
